#: Readme_MPI.md:1
msgid "Processes: MPI"
msgstr "Processes：MPI"

#: Readme_MPI.md:24
msgid ""
"In this case the parallelization strategy passes through parallel processes:"
" with `unsigned rank = comm.Get_rank()` we inform the function wich is the "
"this process, with `unsigned stride = comm.Get_size()` we want to know the "
"number of processes that partecipate to the calculation."
msgstr ""
"この場合は、複数の Processes によって並列化する。`unsigned rank = comm.Get_rank()` で現在の Process"
" を関数に伝え、`unsigned stride = comm.Get_size()` で計算に参加する Process 数を得る。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:27
msgid ""
"The strategy here is to split the outer for cycle between the processes, so "
"that each process will do only part of the loop. We are doing by hand what "
"the `#pragma for` does behind the curtains in the threaded example. The "
"original cycle `for (unsigned int i0 = 0; i0 < nn; ++i0)` became `for "
"(unsigned int i0 = rank; i0 < nn; i0 += stride)`: `stride` ensures that the "
"calculation won't overlap."
msgstr ""
"ここでは、外側の for ループを Processes に分配し、それぞれが一部だけを実行する。Threading の例で `#pragma for` "
"が内部で行う処理を、手作業で実装している。元のループ `for (unsigned int i0 = 0; i0 < nn; ++i0)` を `for"
" (unsigned int i0 = rank; i0 < nn; i0 += stride)` に変える。`stride` "
"によって計算の重複を防ぐ。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:30
msgid ""
"We have less risk of having a data race because all the variable are "
"instantiated for each different processor, meaning that non only the for "
"loop is executed in parallel but that the change in data in a process won't "
"affect other processes!"
msgstr ""
"各 Process に変数を個別に生成するため、Data Race の危険は小さい。for ループが並列に実行されるだけでなく、ある Process "
"のデータ変更が、他の Processes に影響しない。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:32
msgid ""
"We have then the problem of obtaining the correct result: we have to set "
"`ncoord` to the sum of all the `ncoord` in the various processes. To do this"
" sum we use the Plumed mpi inteface: `comm.Sum(ncoord)` this will call the "
"reduction sum algorithm of the MPI library with no complications. Plumed "
"tools used:"
msgstr ""
"次に、正しい結果を得る必要がある。各 Process の `ncoord` をすべて合計し、その値を `ncoord` に設定する。PLUMED の "
"MPI Interface `comm.Sum(ncoord)` を使うと、MPI ライブラリの Reduction Sum を簡単に呼べる。使用する "
"PLUMED のツールは次のとおりである。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:36
msgid ""
"`tools/Communicator.h` is present as the variable `comm` that is inherited "
"through `PLMD::Action`. `PLMD::Communicator` is an interface to some of the "
"functionalities of the C API of mpi.h"
msgstr ""
"`tools/Communicator.h` の機能は、`PLMD::Action` から継承する変数 `comm` "
"として使える。`PLMD::Communicator` は、mpi.h の C API の一部を扱う Interface である。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:38
msgid ""
"`PLMD::Communicator::Get_size()` to get the number of the processes spawned "
"by mpirun"
msgstr "`PLMD::Communicator::Get_size()`：mpirun が起動した Process 数を取得する。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:39
msgid "`PLMD::Communicator::Get_rank()` to get the id of the process"
msgstr "`PLMD::Communicator::Get_rank()`：Process の ID を取得する。"

#: Readme_MPI.md:40
msgid ""
"`PLMD::Communicator::Sum()` to obtain the correct sum of `ncoord` from all "
"the processes"
msgstr "`PLMD::Communicator::Sum()`：すべての Processes の `ncoord` を正しく合計する。"

